<p>I had this idea at random today thanks to that song. So, I'm paying tribute to my home state of North Carolina with a coldpost about a shrooms-eating, acid-tabbing, DMT-huffing agender<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-613061-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-613061-1')">1</a></sup> redneck with self-actualization issues. Oh, and their friend, who is a ball of flesh and dirt.</p>
<hr />
<p>Photograph taken by me.</p>
